-- words --
When Stable refuses a run on a commit other than H0, its refusal prints both outputs as it does today: the example's Probe prints bad on the first run of a second commit and ok on the next, and the refusal shows bad as the first output and ok as the second.
-- run --
HYP_ACTOR=runner-1 HYP_ROLE=runner hyp run ROW GOAL/line-1
-- floor: contains --
gave different verdicts; the first stands
-- floor: contains --
bytes:
bad
-- floor: contains --
bytes:
ok
